,"source":"https://www.indagare.com/destinations/caribbean-caribbean/harbour-island/restaurants","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Acquapazza Wine Bar & Ristorante","blurb":"\"Laid-back restaurant on the marina with Italian-inspired seafood menu.\"","si":["culinary","wine","romance"],"commission":"venue","wells":["eat"],"draw_rank":25,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.indagare.com/destinations/caribbean-caribbean/harbour-island/restaurants","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Rooster Tail Bar & Grill","blurb":"Valentines'' waterfront restaurant with \"fresh local ingredients, scenic waterfront views\"; Friday Fish Fry and Wednesday live music on the weekly list","si":["culinary","entertainment"],"commission":"venue","wells":["eat"],"draw_rank":26,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.valentinesresort.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Harbour Island day away (Bahamas Ferries)","blurb":"\"A walking/golf cart tour of the beautiful little Island of Harbour Island\" in Bahamas Ferries'' day away package from Nassau; Bahamas Ferry Services Ltd., (242) 323-2165","si":["group","senior","family"],"commission":"bundle","wells":["activities","move"],"draw_rank":27,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://bahamas.com/vendor/harbour-island-tour","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Audre''s Rentals boat tours","blurb":"\"captains have been customizing trips around Harbour Island for more than twenty years,\" including turtle and starfish viewing","si":["ocean","wildlife","family"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities","gear","move"],"draw_rank":28,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://thepointsguy.com/news/10-reasons-discover-harbour-island-bahamas","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Bahamas Coffee Roasters","blurb":"\"An island institution loved by locals and visitors alike, this café serves freshly roasted coffee and a selection of lunch items.\"","si":["culinary"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities","eat"],"draw_rank":29,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.indagare.com/destinations/caribbean-caribbean/harbour-island/restaurants","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Elbow Room","blurb":"\"cute and casual\" spot next to The Landing","si":["culinary","entertainment"],"commission":"venue","wells":["eat","stay"],"draw_rank":30,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://thepointsguy.com/news/10-reasons-discover-harbour-island-bahamas","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text + food SI (David 2026-10-05: every traveler has to eat)"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is worth doing in Harbour Island?","a":"Pink Sands Beach — the iconic 3-mile pink beach.","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g148423-d147530-Reviews-Pink_Sands_Beach-Harbour_Island_Out_Islands_Bahamas.html"},{"q":"How do I get to Harbour Island from North Eleuthera?","a":"\"Take a short taxi ride from North Eleuthera Airport to Three Island Dock, then board a public water taxi to Harbour Island. Water taxis operate continuously, with departures every 30 minutes or so. The transfer to Dunmore Town on Harbour Island takes around 10 minutes.\"","source":"https://andrewharper.com/read/article/know-before-you-go-harbour-island-bahamas/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"How do I get to Harbour Island from Nassau?","a":"By air or by ferry. The official site lists \"Bahamasair: Multiple daily flights from Nassau (NAS) to North Eleuthera (ELH)\", the closest airport to Harbour Island, and says \"Regular ferry services operate between Nassau (New Providence) and Eleuthera, including Spanish Wells and Harbour Island. Operators: Bahamas Ferries, Current Pride, MV Daybreak, and Island Link\", taking \"Approximately 2.5 to 3 hours depending on the destination.\"","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/plan-your-trip/getting-here","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is there a ferry from Nassau to Harbour Island?","a":"Yes. Bahamas Ferries, Current Pride, MV Daybreak and Island Link are named by the official site as operators between Nassau and Eleuthera, including Harbour Island. Bahamas Ferries takes reservations at reservations@bahamasferries.com or (242) 323-2166 Ext. 250 and lists a Harbour Island office.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/plan-your-trip/getting-here","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"How do I get to Harbour Island from Miami?","a":"Fly to North Eleuthera (ELH): \"American Airlines and Delta offer nonstop flights from Miami (MIA) to North Eleuthera (ELH).\" Then a taxi to Three Island Dock and a water taxi across.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/plan-your-trip/getting-here","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"How do I get to Harbour Island from Atlanta?","a":"\"Delta Air Lines offers nonstop flights from Hartsfield–Jackson Atlanta International (ATL) to North Eleuthera (ELH)\", the airport closest to Harbour Island.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/plan-your-trip/getting-here","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"What is the Harbour Island, Bahamas airport code?","a":"Harbour Island has no airport of its own. The official site names \"North Eleuthera Airport (ELH / MYEH): Closest to Harbour Island and the most frequently used for northern access.\"","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/plan-your-trip/getting-here","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Can you drive to Harbour Island?","a":"No. \"Quiet and picturesque, Harbour Island is accessible only by ferry or boat from mainland Eleuthera.\"","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/eleuthera-harbour-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is Harbour Island part of Eleuthera?","a":"It is its own island off the northeast coast of Eleuthera Island, reached \"by airplane through North Eleuthera Airport, followed by a short water taxi ride from neighbouring North Eleuthera.\" The official tourism site groups the two as \"Eleuthera & Harbour Island\".","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harbour_Island,_Bahamas","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is there an all-inclusive on Harbour Island, Bahamas?","a":"Eleven Bahama House publishes all-inclusive rates for 2026-2027: individual rooms from $1,540 nightly (double occupancy) and private buyouts from $13,773 nightly for 22 guests, 3-night minimum, including daily chef-prepared meals, boat excursions and airport transfers. It was the only property read this session that states an all-inclusive basis.","source":"https://elevenexperience.com/bahama-house-harbour-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"When is hurricane season for a Harbour Island trip?","a":"TravelWell names no best month from a source. NOAA: \"The Atlantic hurricane season runs from June 1 to November 30.\" \"The peak of the Atlantic hurricane season is September 10, with most activity occurring between mid-August and mid-October.\"","source":"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/climo/","accessed":"2026-10-02"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Harbour Island Bahamas: Pink Sands Luxury Escape","meta_description":"Stay steps from Harbour Island''s famous pink-sand beach at Coral Sands or Pink Sands Resort — barefoot-luxe Bahamas honeymoons. When to go and how.","slug":"harbour-island-bahamas","primary_keyword":"Harbour Island Pink Sands Beach","long_tail":["Coral Sands Hotel Harbour Island","Pink Sands Resort Bahamas honeymoon","Dunmore Town Eleuthera","Harbour Island luxury Bahamas","North Eleuthera water taxi"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-02","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-02","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_ag